---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import Block from "../components/Block.astro";
import Header from "../components/Header.astro";
import Grid from "../components/Grid.astro";
import Card from "../components/Card.astro";
import CardSmall from "../components/CardSmall.astro";
import CardTall from "../components/CardTall.astro";
import Button from "../components/Button.astro";
---

<Layout>
    <Header>about me</Header>

    <Block>
        <h3>hello <span class="accent-dim">friends!!</span> &gt</h3>
        i’m <b>narawutti wongwandanee (<span class="font-thai">ณราวุฒิ วงษ์วันทนีย์</span>)</b>, but i go by <b>brahm (<span class="font-thai">บราห์ม</span>)</b>.<br><br>
        i was born in <b>bangkok, thailand</b> and i grew up in calgary, alberta!
        currently i live in vancouver, bc taking my 3rd year of computer science at the university of british columbia!<br><br>
        i’m currently working on <b>godot, c#, c++,</b> and <b>figma</b> in my free time.<br><br>
        i’m a huge extrovert, and i love to chat. reach out if you wanna talk about anything!<br><br>
        <span class="code-block-dim">email: wnarawutti@gmail.com</span><br><span class="code-block-dim">discord: @brahm</span>
    </Block>

    <Block theme="dark">
        <h3><span class="accent-extracurriculars">extracurricular</span> involvement &gt</h3>

        <Grid columns="2">
            <Card title="UBC Esports Association" description="RG Director → VP Marketing (2024-Ongoing)" colour="var(--colour-extracurriculars)" image="/images/misc-thumb/ubcea-thumb.jpg"></Card>
            <Card title="NanoRooms" description="Animation Intern (2026-Ongoing)" colour="var(--colour-extracurriculars)" image="/images/misc-thumb/nanorooms-thumb.png"></Card>
        </Grid>
    </Block>

    <Block>
        <h3>how did i get here? &gt</h3>
        i’ve loved coding since my elementary school teacher taught me about <b>scratch</b> in 4th grade, and embarassingly, 
        i made a lot of five night’s at freddy’s fan fictions...<br><br>

        in junior high, i moved on to making <b>discord bots in python</b> for me and my friends to use, and i started work on small game projects using <b>pygame</b>. 
        i also learned <b>html/css/js</b> to create a webpage for my discord bot (to varying degrees of success)<br><br>

        in high school, i wanted to pivot into studying medicine. but, programming remained a fun hobby for me, which is when i learned <b>java</b> to create a few simple Minecraft mods. 
        i also started <b>illustration</b> (to impress a girl at first 😭), but i fell in love with the craft and now it’s the hobby that i spend the most time with.<br><br>

        because of medicine, my first two years of university had very little programming work done. however, i fell out of love with studying biology, 
        and i switched majors to <b>computer science</b>. now that i’m doing something i’m passionate about, i’m happier than ever!
    </Block>

    <Block theme="dark">
        <h3><span class="accent-osu">osu!</span> career &gt</h3>

        <Grid>
            <CardSmall title="peak rank" description="global#736 ca#36" colour="var(--colour-osu-dim)" />
            <CardSmall title="mapping" description="60+ maps created" colour="var(--colour-osu-dim)" />
            <CardSmall title="tournament staffing" description="6+ hosted, 12+ cred. staff roles" colour="var(--colour-osu-dim)" />
        </Grid>

        <br>
        <Button theme="light" link="https://osu.ppy.sh/users/5554231">visit my profile</Button>
        <br>
        <b>osu!</b> is a community-driven rhythm game that i have been involved with for over <b>11 years. </b> 
        i have competed in multiple tournaments, and i’m heavily involved with the local osu! and rhythm game scene.
    </Block>

